      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## 1. Schedule & partner list\nRun weekly and read the partners you want to monitor, with their stored snapshot."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "730be930-975b-49bb-b296-294d81ba16b9",
      "name": "S2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        512,
        -288
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 768,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## 2. Look up the registry & diff\nQuery gBizINFO by corporate number, diff the result against the stored snapshot, and only continue when something actually changed. Lookup failures go to Slack."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2b2d70d7-59a5-4647-badb-958e2b18f5fc",
